an begin="0:33.102" end="0:33.522">ま</span><span begin="0:33.522" end="0:34.082">行っ</span><span begin="0:34.082" end="0:34.592">た</span><span begin="0:34.592" end="0:34.952">ラン</span><span begin="0:34.952" end="0:35.532">チ</span></p><p begin="0:35.915" end="0:42.415" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.915" end="0:36.295">相</span><span begin="0:36.295" end="0:36.785">槌</span><span begin="0:36.785" end="0:37.185">代</span><span begin="0:37.185" end="0:37.545">わ</span><span begin="0:37.545" end="0:37.915">り</span><span begin="0:37.915" end="0:38.405">コー</span><span begin="0:38.405" end="0:38.655">ヒー</span> <span begin="0:38.895" end="0:39.325">飲ん</span><span begin="0:39.325" end="0:39.475">で</span><span begin="0:39.475" end="0:39.675">ば</span><span begin="0:39.675" end="0:39.925">か</span><span begin="0:39.925" end="0:40.265">り</span> <span begin="0:40.605" end="0:40.715">無</span><span begin="0:40.715" end="0:41.205">口</span><span begin="0:41.205" end="0:41.395">な</span><span begin="0:41.395" end="0:41.605">キ</span><span begin="0:41.605" end="0:42.415">ミ</span></p><p begin="0:42.707" end="0:49.267" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.707" end="0:43.157">冗</span><span begin="0:43.157" end="0:43.657">談</span><span begin="0:43.657" end="0:44.357">通</span><span begin="0:44.357" end="0:44.857">じ</span><span begin="0:44.857" end="0:45.127">な</span><span begin="0:45.127" end="0:45.247">く</span><span begin="0:45.247" end="0:45.847">て</span> <span begin="0:46.127" end="0:46.327">そ</span><span begin="0:46.327" end="0:46.637">の</span><span begin="0:46.637" end="0:47.167">割</span><span begin="0:47.167" end="0:47.337">に</span><span begin="0:47.337" end="0:48.297">天</span><span begin="0:48.297" end="0:48.767">然</span><span begin="0:48.767" end="0:49.267">で</span></p><p begin="0:49.616" end="0:55.026" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.616" end="0:50.036">変</span><span begin="0:50.036" end="0:50.196">な</span><span begin="0:50.196" end="0:50.876"